### CONCLUSION
CBD treatment (CBD_IC50 vs DMSO vehicle) in CRC cells is dominated by DOWN-regulation
(138 down vs 84 up DE genes, padj<0.05 & |log2FC|>0.5; down:up ~1.6, robust across df).
The 4 threshold-meeting core metabolic genes (HK1, ALDOA, PDHA1, SLC2A1/GLUT1) are all
down-regulated (GAPDH -0.48 is below threshold but also down). GO BP enrichment could not
be executed (offline, no R); the metabolic direction is thus inferred from the DE ratio +
these metabolic genes: the metabolic effects of CBD are primarily driven by DOWNREGULATION.
